          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Abram said, “O Lord ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", what wilt thou give me, for I continue childless, and the heir of my house is Eliezer of Damascus?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
